  "engine_cannot": "The engine's limit is session-scoped: it sums the events of one session's history, and a caller that opens a new session starts that sum at zero. No policy text in that engine can say \"$500 a day for this tenant, principal and purpose\" across sessions, so it cannot say the budget; the budget is kept by a ledger keyed by (tenant, principal, purpose, day) outside the engine."
